<< /Subtype /application#2Fx-tex/Type /EmbeddedFile /Params<</ModDate (D:20260730) >> /Length 269 >>        
stream
\begin {equation*}\sum _{i=1}^{n-1} \sum _{j=1}^{n-i-1} \sigma _i \sigma _j \sigma _{n-i-j} = \sum _{\substack {s+t+u = n \\ s, t, u \geqslant 1}} \sigma _s \sigma _t \sigma _u = \sum _{i=1}^{n-1} \sum _{j=1}^{i-1} \sigma _j \sigma _{i-j} \sigma _{n-i}.\end {equation*}
endstream
